# test output & cache
Testing/
.cache/

# The ROM. A build artifact: ./make.sh produces it from this tree, and the
# README says so. It used to be tracked AND listed here, which meant the line
# did nothing and every rebuild committed another copy of a 435 KB binary.
*.nds

